==============================================================================
Third-party software
==============================================================================

- wmi_spoof_msimg32.dll
  A community-built WMI-spoofing proxy DLL (self-signed, author certificate
  CN=ChsBuffer). It masquerades as msimg32.dll, gets loaded by
  MiSmartShareHost and hooks WMI's CWbemObject::Get so that
  Win32_BaseBoard.Manufacturer / .Product are reported as XIAOMI / TM2424.
  Hooking is built on Microsoft Detours (https://github.com/microsoft/Detours).
  This repository includes the binary **unmodified, as obtained from its
  community distribution**; it is not rebuilt or patched here. Copyright and
  all rights remain with its original author.

- Xiaomi PC Manager (小米电脑管家)
  Proprietary software of Xiaomi. NOT included in this repository and NOT
  redistributed here; users must obtain the installer themselves. The patch
  tools in this repository modify a locally installed copy at byte level and
  write runtime configuration; no Xiaomi code is published from here.

- Xiaomi, Mi, 小米电脑管家 and related names and marks belong to their
  respective owners. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
  Xiaomi.

==============================================================================
Logs and credentials
==============================================================================

This repository stores **no credentials and no install logs**. Installer and
runtime logs (pcc_install_log.txt, install_log.txt) contain machine
information and are excluded by .gitignore. See docs/DOC-RULES.md section 2
for the redaction rules that apply to this repository.
